{"seq":1,"slug":"slowmoving-deadstock-rule-alert","title":"呆滞/死库存识别规则与预警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/obsolete-excess-detect/slowmoving-deadstock-rule-alert","wordCount":1838,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"呆滞-死库存识别规则与预警\">呆滞/死库存识别规则与预警</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「呆滞」与「死库存」在日常对话里被混着用，但在治理动作上必须严格区分。<strong>呆滞（slow-moving）是动销速度下降到不可接受的程度，但仍有需求</strong>，处置手段是促销、调拨、降价；<strong>死库存（dead stock / obsolete）是需求已经结构性消失或商品已过期/淘汰</strong>，处置手段是清仓、退货、捐赠、报废。前者是速度问题，后者是终局问题；把死库存当呆滞去促销，只会浪费促销资源并拉低价格带。</p>\n<p>识别呆滞的标准工程口径是<strong>连续无动销周数 / 供应周数</strong>。业界常说的「供应周数」（weeks of supply）定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>WOS</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>当前可售库存</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>近期周均出库</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{WOS} = \\text{当前可售库存} / \\text{近期周均出库}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">WOS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当前可售库存</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">近期周均出库</span></span></span></span></span></span>，当 WOS 超过阈值（如 26 周）即判呆滞。这个口径与 <a href=\"../inventory-health-metric/age-bucket-dio-turnover\">库龄分布与 DIO</a> 的 DIO 是同一物理量的不同表达——DIO 以天计、面向财务，WOS 以周计、面向采购。两处必须共用同一份出库数据，否则会出现「DIO 显示正常、WOS 显示呆滞」的口径冲突。</p>\n<p>规则引擎的设计难点不在公式，而在<strong>如何处理间歇需求</strong>。当一个 SKU 在过去 90 天只有 3 次出库时，「周均出库」这个分母既小又不可靠，WOS 会被算成几百周，把季节性长尾误判成死库存。按 <a href=\"https://otexts.com/fpp3/accuracy.html\">Forecasting: Principles and Practice</a> 的说明，百分比误差在间歇需求下会失效——MAPE「is infinite or undefined if <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_t=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> for any <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>」，且会产生「extreme values if any <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> is close to zero」。同样的问题会传染给 WOS，所以呆滞规则必须叠加<strong>二阶判据</strong>，而不是只看一个比值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[SKU×仓 日快照] --&gt; B{90 天出库次数}&#10;  B --&gt;|&lt; 3 次| C[间歇需求分支]&#10;  B --&gt;|&gt;= 3 次| D[常规分支]&#10;  C --&gt; E{最近一次出库距今}&#10;  E --&gt;|&gt; 180 天| F[死库存候选]&#10;  E --&gt;|90-180 天| G[呆滞候选&lt;br/&gt;需人工复核]&#10;  D --&gt; H[WOS = 可售库存 / 周均出库]&#10;  H --&gt; I{WOS &gt; 26}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[呆滞]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K[健康]&#10;  F --&gt; L[终局处置&lt;br/&gt;清仓/退货/捐赠/报废]&#10;  J --&gt; M[促销/调拨/降价建议]&#10;  N[一票否决&lt;br/&gt;过期/停产/召回] --&gt; F\">graph TD\n  A[SKU×仓 日快照] --&gt; B{90 天出库次数}\n  B --&gt;|&lt; 3 次| C[间歇需求分支]\n  B --&gt;|&gt;= 3 次| D[常规分支]\n  C --&gt; E{最近一次出库距今}\n  E --&gt;|&gt; 180 天| F[死库存候选]\n  E --&gt;|90-180 天| G[呆滞候选&lt;br/&gt;需人工复核]\n  D --&gt; H[WOS = 可售库存 / 周均出库]\n  H --&gt; I{WOS &gt; 26}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[呆滞]\n  I --&gt;|否| K[健康]\n  F --&gt; L[终局处置&lt;br/&gt;清仓/退货/捐赠/报废]\n  J --&gt; M[促销/调拨/降价建议]\n  N[一票否决&lt;br/&gt;过期/停产/召回] --&gt; F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>阈值示例</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n<th>处置方向</th>\n<th>误判风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>供应周数 WOS</td>\n<td>&gt; 26 周</td>\n<td>呆滞</td>\n<td>促销、调拨</td>\n<td>促销后脉冲造成假健康</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续无动销</td>\n<td>&gt; 90 天</td>\n<td>呆滞</td>\n<td>降价、渠道切换</td>\n<td>长尾品误判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续无动销</td>\n<td>&gt; 180 天</td>\n<td>死库存候选</td>\n<td>清仓、退货</td>\n<td>新上市品无历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库龄</td>\n<td>&gt; 365 天</td>\n<td>死库存候选</td>\n<td>报废评估</td>\n<td>高值耐用品误判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保质期剩余</td>\n<td>&lt; 1/3 保质期</td>\n<td>强制呆滞</td>\n<td>紧急清仓</td>\n<td>无（硬约束）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期状态</td>\n<td>EOL / 停产</td>\n<td>死库存</td>\n<td>退货、报废</td>\n<td>无（硬约束）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"规则引擎的设计\">规则引擎的设计</h2><h3 id=\"分层规则-硬约束先于统计判据\">分层规则：硬约束先于统计判据</h3><p>规则必须<strong>分层执行、短路返回</strong>。第一层是硬约束：已过保质期、已停产（EOL）、已被召回、已被平台下架的 SKU，无需任何统计计算，直接进入终局处置通道。第二层是统计判据（WOS、连续无动销、库龄）。第三层是复核队列：命中统计判据但未命中硬约束的，进入人工复核。</p>\n<p>短路顺序不可颠倒。如果把统计判据放在前面，一个已停产但上周刚好清了一批尾货的 SKU 会因为 WOS 下降而逃过识别，这是治理体系里最常见的一种漏网。</p>\n<h3 id=\"状态机而非一次性判定\">状态机而非一次性判定</h3><p>呆滞是一个<strong>状态</strong>，不是一次判断。SKU 会「进入呆滞」「在呆滞中」「退出呆滞」「复发」。用状态机建模的价值是：可以统计平均呆滞持续时长、可以防止反复进出造成的动作抖动、可以把「已进入呆滞但无人处理」单独告警。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rule_set&quot;: &quot;deadstock-v3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;evaluated_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;granularity&quot;: &quot;sku_x_warehouse&quot;,&#10;  &quot;hard_constraints&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;expiry&quot;,&#10;      &quot;when&quot;: &quot;days_to_expiry &lt; shelf_life_days / 3&quot;,&#10;      &quot;state&quot;: &quot;DEAD_CANDIDATE&quot;,&#10;      &quot;skip_statistics&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;eol&quot;, &quot;when&quot;: &quot;lifecycle_status == &#39;EOL&#39;&quot;, &quot;state&quot;: &quot;DEAD_CANDIDATE&quot;, &quot;skip_statistics&quot;: true },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;recall&quot;, &quot;when&quot;: &quot;recall_flag == true&quot;, &quot;state&quot;: &quot;DEAD_CANDIDATE&quot;, &quot;skip_statistics&quot;: true }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;statistics&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;no_movement_90&quot;,&#10;      &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;days_since_last_issue&quot;,&#10;      &quot;op&quot;: &quot;gt&quot;,&#10;      &quot;value&quot;: 90,&#10;      &quot;state&quot;: &quot;SLOW_MOVING&quot;,&#10;      &quot;min_issues_90d&quot;: 0&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;wos_high&quot;,&#10;      &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;weeks_of_supply&quot;,&#10;      &quot;op&quot;: &quot;gt&quot;,&#10;      &quot;value&quot;: 26,&#10;      &quot;state&quot;: &quot;SLOW_MOVING&quot;,&#10;      &quot;min_issues_90d&quot;: 3&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;dead_180&quot;,&#10;      &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;days_since_last_issue&quot;,&#10;      &quot;op&quot;: &quot;gt&quot;,&#10;      &quot;value&quot;: 180,&#10;      &quot;state&quot;: &quot;DEAD_CANDIDATE&quot;,&#10;      &quot;min_issues_90d&quot;: 0&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;intermittent_guard&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;when&quot;: &quot;issues_90d &lt; 3&quot;,&#10;    &quot;require_secondary&quot;: [&quot;days_since_last_issue &gt; 90&quot;, &quot;aged_365d_share &gt; 0.5&quot;],&#10;    &quot;note&quot;: &quot;avoid WOS blow-up on lumpy demand&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;severity&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;SLOW_MOVING&quot;: { &quot;sla_days&quot;: 14, &quot;owner_role&quot;: &quot;category_ops&quot; },&#10;    &quot;DEAD_CANDIDATE&quot;: { &quot;sla_days&quot;: 30, &quot;owner_role&quot;: &quot;inventory_controller&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_set\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"deadstock-v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evaluated_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"granularity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sku_x_warehouse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"hard_constraints\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"expiry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"days_to_expiry &#x3C; shelf_life_days / 3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DEAD_CANDIDATE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"skip_statistics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eol\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lifecycle_status == 'EOL'\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DEAD_CANDIDATE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"skip_statistics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recall\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recall_flag == true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DEAD_CANDIDATE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"skip_statistics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"statistics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no_movement_90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"days_since_last_issue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"value\"</span>